# The live switch by mouse and keys. `live` is at x 736..776, y 21..43 and
# off; `on` at x 600..640 and checked. Browser checkbox semantics are the oracle.
listen pointerdown pointerup click input change keydown keyup focusin
click 756 32                  a click toggles on, input and change after the click
expect event pointerdown input#live
expect event click input#live
expect event input input#live
expect event change input#live
expect focus input#live
expect checked input#live true
key Space                     Space toggles it off on keyup
expect event keyup input#live
expect event change input#live
expect checked input#live false
key Enter                     Enter does nothing to a switch
expect no event click
expect checked input#live false
key Tab                       Tab goes to the next control in the document, keyboard focus visible
expect focus-visible input#on
